<title>USA: Furr's/Bishop's names Papit president/CEO.</title>
<headline>Furr's/Bishop's names Papit president/CEO.</headline>
<dateline>LUBBOCK, Texas 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Furr's/Bishop's Inc said Friday its board had appointed restaurant industry veteran Ted Papit as president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Papit previously served as president and CEO of Black-Eyed Pea Restaurants Inc, from 1988 through 1996, and Casa Bonita Inc.</p>
<p>At Furr's. Papit will assume the duties of Ken Reimer, who has acted as interim president and CEO since January 1997. Reimer will remain on the board.</p>
<p>Furr's operates over 100 cafeterias, buffets and specialty restaurants in the Southwest, West and Midwest.</p>
</text>
